## Walrus Component Catalog (v83.1.5)

### Buttons & Actions
- **Button**: `import { Button } from '@do/walrus'`
  - Variations: `primary` | `secondary` | `tertiary` | `icon` | `success` | `danger` | `danger-secondary` | `list-item` | `banner` | `banner-secondary`
  - Props: `compact`, `active`, `fullWidth`, `url`, `external`, `icon`, `iconSize`, `iconRight`, `disabled`
  - [Storybook](https://walrus.internal.digitalocean.com/?path=/docs/button)
  
- **SpinnerButton**: `import { SpinnerButton } from '@do/walrus'`
  - Button with loading state

- **InlineButton**: `import { InlineButton } from '@do/walrus'`
  - Inline text-style button

- **UnstyledButton**: `import { UnstyledButton } from '@do/walrus'`
  - Base button with no styles

### Form Controls
- **TextInput**: `import { TextInput, Input } from '@do/walrus'`
  - Standard text input with label, error states
  - Utils: `Label`, `ErrorMessage`, `RequiredAsterisk`

- **TextArea**: `import { TextArea } from '@do/walrus'`
  - Multi-line text input

- **Checkbox**: `import { Checkbox } from '@do/walrus'`

